{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat /home/micha/.claude/skills/game-toolchain/SKILL.md'","aggregated_output":"---\nname: game-toolchain\ndescription: Blender/Godot/texture/audio/tilemap/font toolchain on this box and its headless gotchas — use for any 3D, 2D, sprite, audio or Godot asset work\n---\n\n# Game asset creation toolchain (installed 2026-09-16 — do NOT reinstall)\n\nAll userspace, all driveable headlessly by an agent. Check `command -v` first.\n\n- **3D / Blender:** `blender` 5.2.2 LTS (`~/.local/opt/blender`, symlinked). Headless:\n  `blender --background --factory-startup --python script.py`. Cycles **GPU works via CUDA**\n  (RTX 4070 SUPER); OptiX is unavailable under WSL — set `compute_device_type='CUDA'`.\n  Blender as a *library* instead: `bpy-python -c \"import bpy; ...\"` (venv `~/.venvs/bpy`, cp313 wheel).\n- **3D mesh/CLI:** `assimp` (40+ format convert), `draco_encoder`, `gltfpack`, `gltf-transform`,\n  `gltf-pipeline`, `obj2gltf`, `gltf_validator` (Khronos; `-o` = JSON to stdout — don't merge stderr).\n- **Textures:** `magick` (IM7), `oiiotool` (OpenImageIO: EXR/mips), `toktx` + `ktx` (KTX2/Basis —\n  **`ktx create` takes INPUT then OUTPUT**), `basisu`, `cwebp`, `avifenc`, `heif-enc`,\n  optimizers `oxipng` `pngquant` `jpegoptim` `gifsicle` `zopflipng`.\n- **Vector:** `resvg`, `rsvg-convert` (SVG→raster), `potrace` (raster→SVG), `svgo` (npm).\n- **2D / sprites:** `pack-atlas` (helper — wraps free-tex-packer-cli; exporters incl. Godot, Phaser 3,\n  Unity3D, Spine: `pack-atlas sprites/*.png -o out -e \"Godot (atlas)\"`), `libresprite` (pixel art;\n  batch `libresprite -b in.png --sheet out.png --data out.json`), `rembg i in.png out.png` (cutouts).\n- **Tilemaps:** `tiled`, `tmxrasterizer` (map→PNG), `tmxviewer`, `terraingenerator`.\n- **Fonts:** `msdf-atlas-gen` (SDF/MSDF atlases for GPU text), `fonttools` / `ttx` / `pyftsubset`.\n- **Audio:** `sox` (procedural SFX: `sox -n hit.wav synth 0.2 sine 300-900 fade t 0.01 0.2 0.15`),\n  `ffmpeg`, `fluidsynth` + GM soundfont at `~/.local/share/soundfonts/MuseScore_General.sf3`,\n  `lame` `flac` `opusenc` `oggenc` `wavpack`.\n  ⚠ this `ffmpeg` has **no libvorbis** — for Ogg Vorbis use `sox in.wav out.ogg` or `oggenc` (16-bit input).\n- **Engine:** `godot` 4.7.2 + **export templates installed**. Headless:\n  `godot --headless --import`, `godot --headless --export-release \"Linux\" build/game.x86_64`.\n- **Python stack:** `gamedev-python` → venv `~/.venvs/gamedev` (trimesh, pymeshlab, open3d, xatlas,\n  pygltflib, meshio, usd-core/`pxr`, MaterialX, Pillow, OpenCV, scikit-image, shapely, rectpack,\n  librosa, soundfile, fontTools, numpy/scipy). Shims on PATH: `trimesh` `meshio` `open3d` `ttx` …\n\n**Headless gotchas already handled by the wrappers in `~/.local/bin` — don't \"fix\" them:**\n- Tiled bundles only Qt's `xcb` plugin → wrappers auto-run under `xvfb-run` when `$DISPLAY` is unset.\n- LibreSprite needs an SDL target even for `-b` → wrapper sets `SDL_VIDEODRIVER=dummy` when headless.\n- pymeshlab/open3d need `libOpenGL.so.0` + `libusb` → `~/.local/lib` (libglvnd extracted from the\n  Ubuntu .deb, no sudo) + brew lib are put on `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` by the venv wrappers.\n- Never symlink a venv `python` into `~/.local/bin` — it breaks `sys.prefix`. Use an `exec` wrapper.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
