{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"agent_message","text":"The combat model is in place: finite spawn queues, one bolt per player, shared visibility, bell reveal and lure effects, safe portal travel, familiar chases, and the three-part finale. I’m now adding the native art and menus, plus tests for collision and checkpoint edge cases.\n"}}
