{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"agent_message","text":"The first bundled HTML builds, and the game boots headlessly without runtime errors. I’m running a full campaign pilot through ordinary movement, aim, and fire commands to check whether the encounters are winnable and progression holds together.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_45","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='src/art.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\"legend:{'#':1}\\\",\\\"legend:{'#':1,B:'bell',P:'portal'}\\\");open(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/main.js';s=open(p).read().replace(\\\" if(game.paused&&\"'!app.network.active)for(const p of game.players)p.clear();\",\"\");open(p,'\"'w').write(s)\nPY\ncat > tests/first-look.py <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nroot=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\nname=root.name+'.html'\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n browser=p.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n page=browser.new_page(viewport={'width':1920,'height':1080})\n errors=[]\n page.on('pageerror',lambda e:errors.append(str(e)))\n page.goto((root/name).as_uri())\n page.wait_for_function('window.__game && window.__game.sceneName === \\\"title\\\"')\n page.screenshot(path=str(root/'evidence/title-first.png'))\n page.get_by_role('button',name='Play',exact=True).click()\n page.get_by_role('button',name='Normal — 3 lives, intended pressure',exact=True).click()\n page.wait_for_function('IW.app.world && IW.app.world.phase === \\\"Hunt\\\"')\n page.screenshot(path=str(root/'evidence/play-first.png'))\n print({'errors':errors,'snapshot':page.evaluate('({errors:__game.errors,world:IW.app.world.export(false),size:[__game.W,__game.H],zoom:__game.zoom})')})\n browser.close()\nPY\nnode tools/build.mjs\n/home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/bin/python tests/first-look.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
