{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_74","type":"agent_message","text":"All three campaign tests now pass—solo Normal, solo Gentle, and two-player Fierce—and each exercises a bell and portal through ordinary controls. Browser testing has found two more integration issues: oversized developer panels and a false controller-disconnect pause when assigning couch devices. I’m checking those fixes alongside phone framing and shared combat.\n"}}
