{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_84","type":"agent_message","text":"The expanded browser suite passes in Chromium, Firefox, and the WebKit phone profile. The shared-combat test confirms that both peers see the same kills, cloak state, familiar bonus, three finale hits, and final score, then stop sending after the round ends. I’m finishing the credits, feedback, authoring notes, and release checks.\n"}}
