{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_99","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Verification and release work\n+- All 38 simulation/integration checks now pass. Includes three command-only campaigns with bell + portal use, plus a complete native E.Game run through results, credits and Replay.\n+- Prior browser run: all 25 checks passed across Chromium, Firefox and WebKit phone profiles, including standard-mapped pad, rebinding, co-op device ownership, touch cancellation, 10-second attract, developer tuning/reset and audio PCM.\n+- Hub standard, host-leave and no-player-server conformance pass with latency 150 ms, jitter 50 ms and loss 5%. A separate two-peer combat test passed both players' kills, union visibility, local menus, final familiar, three finale hits, matching 28,800 team score, and no traffic/audio after end. Largest recorded packet 4,942 bytes.\n+- Added terminal snapshot acknowledgement, all-dev-control coverage, contact-sensitive touch target/bell firing, all-device attract wake tests, actual settings reload/defeat-retry checks, and stricter checkpoint validation. Expanded full release suite currently running.\n+- Distinct implementation issues: 10 fixed, including 2 critical. Details in dev/evidence/issues.md. Incorrect test assumptions excluded.\n+- Feedback populated in dev/interview.json; embedded Source Information + all feedback pages use that same JSON. No engine source edits; original shapes/weapon and game adapters extend native systems. Hub script remains byte-identical.\n+- Keep only pinned engine + relevant handoff docs/reference kit; unused sparse clone checkouts removed. Source formatted with Biome. No external runtime assets/dependencies.\n+- Remaining: inspect expanded-suite results, finalize source-year artifact filename, final root HTML/interview build and exact-package checks, update this file, stop only our recorded test server (session 79434, port 40563).\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
